  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3108.04 Renewal of Approved Drivers’ School License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3108.04 Renewal of Approved Drivers’ School License. A renewal of an approved drivers’ school license shall be issued when the applicant:\n\n(a) Submits a completed application, pursuant to Saf-C 3108.02; and\n\n(b) Pays the appropriate fee, pursuant to RSA 263:44.\n\nSource. #9568, eff 10-17-09; ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3111.04) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
